        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Each campus/hospital/Laboratory (the Laboratory shall provide such information in its current format) shall remit at least monthly to AFSCME in the form of a remittance to an address designated by AFSCME an amount representing the authorized dues deductions, agency fee service fees and other designated deductions. The University shall submit a standard deduction report which shall contain by campus/hospital, an alphabetical listing of the AFSCME members and fee payers for whom payroll deductions were made. The report shall include the employee identification number, employee name, amount withheld and, earnings that are the basis for the deduction. The report shall be provided electronically via the ftp site. Any costs associated with AFSCME requested changes in the deduction report referenced above shall be fully paid by AFSCME.",
